[b]CSS 1.0.0-beta.5-hotfix.2[/b]

[list]
[*]Fixed CSS skipping outfits on a default Steam install, where the paths of its outfit cache files went past Windows' 260 character limit (Curvy and Cute, BTGG, Beaute Knight Proxima). CSS now uses much shorter cache folders and removes the old ones on its own.[/*]
[/list]

Update: close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. The first launch takes a few extra seconds.

[url=https://github.com/ngodn/CustomShellSystem/releases/tag/v1.0.0-beta.5-hotfix.2]Download CSS 1.0.0-beta.5-hotfix.2[/url]
